From e5fb7cbaca4720d352f615709c561b0ca8ecd4eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 10:01:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/34] vulkan: tiled CONCAT for a transposed second source
 (gated-delta-net conv input at prefill)

The generic concat read qkv^T 40 KB apart per output element: 1.86 ms per GDN layer at ub 1024 (~22 GB/s,
4.5% of prefill). concat_t.comp tiles 32x32 through shared memory so reads and writes are contiguous.
Prefill +4% (4.3k 272 -> 283 t/s, 15k 244 -> 255). GGML_VK_DISABLE_CONCAT_T keeps the generic shader. Test: CONCAT_T.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
